(text "POWER. J0 battery in -> 10A ATO -> SMDJ58CA -> LM74800 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 back-to-back (VBAT_P).\nOV 30.3V / UV 5.5V (191k/45.3k/10k, 1.231V thresholds). LM5176 buck-boost -> +12V (FB 140k/10k, RT 27k ~290kHz).\nTPS56637 -> +5V (FB 75k/10k = 5.1V). TPS629210 -> +3V3 from +12V via MBR0540 (FB 100k/22.1k). 3V3 1A budget MARGINAL - see notes." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9eacd2dc-9455-4b44-8e37-d40ffdefad54"))
)
